                <pb facs="0883" n="795" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg795"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCormick to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. McCormick reports that the Russian Government consents to the protection of
                    seals in the Pacific on the conditions indicated in Department’s telegram of the
                    4th instant.)</p>
            </div>
